l service. No pets are allowed on the premises. No smoking is permitted inside the apartments. No parties are permitted on the premises. Breach of these rules may result in additional charges, forfeiture of your deposit, or termination of your stay without refund, at our discretion. 6 Children There is no age limit for children. Guests of all ages are welcome. 7 Parking Free parking is available for guests travelling with their own transportation. 8 Taxi & Airport Pickup Service Malfranza offers a taxi service, including airport pickups that can be added to your apartment booking. When you add airport pickup to a stay booking through our platform, a bundle discount may apply as shown at checkout. Taxi bookings are subject to driver availability and confirmation. Malfranza Apartments & Taxi · Guest Policies malfranza@gmail.com9 Amenities Our apartments are outfitted with the following: • • Solar electricity — the property is powered by a solar energy system Starlink high-speed internet — the property is serviced by Starlink satellite internet connection 10 Check-In & Check-Out Check-in: from 3:00 PM Check-out: by 11:00 AM Early check-in and late check-out may be available on request and are subject to availability. A fee of US $35 applies to early check-in or late check-out. 11 Changes to This Policy We may update this Booking Policy from time to time. The version in effect at the time of your booking applies to that booking. Should any additional terms or information arise, we will advise you accordingly. 12 Contact Us Malfranza Apartments & Taxi Barbados Email: malfranza@gmail.com Phone: 1 (246) 234-4875 / 1 (246) 231-4875 This document should be reviewed by a qualified attorney in Barbados before publication.